00:21:10.948 --> 00:21:12.534
So life is 10% what happens to you,

00:21:12.534 --> 00:21:14.437
it's 90% what you do about it.

00:21:14.437 --> 00:21:18.099
Don't you know that however your life is,

00:21:18.099 --> 00:21:20.660
